<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>

<main>
  <section class="hero" style="min-height:60svh; padding-bottom:50px;">
    <div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="blob b1" data-parallax="0.12"></div>
      <div class="blob b3" data-parallax="0.18"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap" style="position:relative; z-index:2">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">About</span>
      <h1 class="reveal"><span class="kinetic">A small studio with</span> <span class="kinetic">one <span class="grad-text">obsession.</span></span></h1>
      <p class="lead reveal" style="--d:0.15s">Local businesses getting found. That is the whole mission statement. Everything else is details.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:20px;">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="reveal-l">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Built for the shops agencies ignore</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:18px">GrowLocal started in Bhopal with a simple observation. The gym on the corner, the salon two streets over, the coaching institute near the bus stand, they all need the same things big brands buy: good reels, a proper website, WhatsApp that answers customers. But agencies quote them city prices, freelancers ghost them, and DIY tools eat their Sundays.</p>
        <p class="lead">So we built the studio we wished existed: fixed prices a shop owner can read in ten seconds, delivery dates we actually keep, and explanations in plain words instead of marketing jargon. Small team, senior standards, honest timelines.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal-r">
        <div class="stats-band" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; margin-top:0">
          <div class="stat"><div class="num"><span data-count="7">0</span></div><div class="lbl">fixed-price services</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="num"><span data-count="48" data-suffix="h">0</span></div><div class="lbl">to first draft, on most services</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="num"><span data-count="1">0</span></div><div class="lbl">point of contact for you</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="num"><span data-count="100" data-suffix="%">0%</span></div><div class="lbl">remote, serving all of India</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">What we believe</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Four rules we work by</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal" style="--d:0s">
          <div class="n">01</div>
          <h3>Say the price first</h3>
          <p>If we cannot tell you what something costs before starting, we have no business selling it. Every quote is fixed and written down.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal" style="--d:0.12s">
          <div class="n">02</div>
          <h3>Explain like a human</h3>
          <p>No jargon, no 40-slide decks about "synergy". You get plain words, short videos, and answers you can actually use.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal" style="--d:0.24s">
          <div class="n">03</div>
          <h3>Ship fast, then support</h3>
          <p>Days, not months. And when something confuses you after delivery, we fix it instead of sending an invoice for "consultation".</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-band reveal">
        <div style="position:relative; z-index:2">
          <h2>Come say hello</h2>
          <p>The fastest way to judge us is a 15 minute call. Free, no pitch decks, no pressure.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Contact us <span class="arr">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
